WEBVTT

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:50.580
OFF TO THE DEPARTMENT STORE

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:04.010
What? You want to join Dai's party?

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:10.980
With this last battle with the Dark Army,
we saw that we have much to learn.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:15.070
We wish to join them and hone our skills.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:19.910
Both of you wait!
I believe that should be my role!

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.930
Amy, you too?!

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:23.930
I will not let you have this!

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:26.440
I will join them on their journey!

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:28.940
Hey! That's not fair, Apollo!

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.070
That's right!

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:31.190
How is it not fair?!

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.520
-What give you the right?!
-In these matters...

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:36.070
What a handful.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:43.220
Stop it, all of you!
You three have a duty to protect Papnica!

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:49.730
Besides, I'm going with Dai.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.770
What?!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.310
What did you just say?

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.090
Huh? Uh, nothing.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:01.510
Leona, can I talk to you?

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:04.640
What is it, Dai?

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.470
A new weapon?

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:11.900
This Steel Broadsword is on its last legs.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.360
Then it's off to Bengarna Kingdom!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.150
Bengarna has a department store!

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.260
What's that?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:25.120
You don't know?
It's a huge building filled with stores!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.010
As big as an inn?

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.560
Don't be silly. It's as big as a castle!

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.870
Wow!

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:36.050
Father took me there once
when I was small.

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:40.090
It was big and huge
and they had everything!

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.010
Oh wow!

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.520
Dai, would you like to go?

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.260
Yeah, I would!

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.400
Now you're talking!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.690
Hmm. I think it was like this.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.150
<i>Th-This is...!</i>

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:07.740
Huh? Mentor?

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:16.420
<i>There's no mistake.
It's the Dragon Crest.</i>

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:20.880
<i>If he really is a Dragon Knight...</i>

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:25.280
<i>Avan, your student
is far more than you knew!</i>

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.510
So do you know what the mark
that shows up on Dai's forehead is?

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:36.130
My mistake. So you mentioned
you want to journey with Dai?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:41.490
Uh, yeah. Is that a no?
I guess I'm still in training, so...

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:02.220
Go on. Consider these a parting gift.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:08.350
The Sorcerer Cape and Shining Staff
I used when I was young.

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:10.560
And this.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.390
Be there for Dai.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:17.810
Huh?

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:22.760
He's going to hit a major wall soon.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:26.660
Not as a Hero, but as a person.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:30.600
When that time comes,
you have to support him.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.710
Understood?

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.750
S-Sure.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:37.920
Man, he was awfully nice today.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.300
These seem pretty cool.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.670
But... well...

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:46.470
This thing's kind of ugly.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.370
Emergency! The balloon on the roof...

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.300
What?!

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.060
No way!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:05:59.610
Princess?!

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:00.610
And Dai?!

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.710
Everyone's asleep from the Snooze spell!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.170
Princess! Come back!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:10.370
Sorry everybody!
We'll be right back, so don't worry!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.120
She always does this.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:17.540
The moment my back is turned,
she sneaks out of the palace.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:22.800
I suppose that just means
peace is returning to Papnica.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.970
Besides, Dai is with her.
They should be fine for a few days.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:30.820
Honestly. After telling us we can't go.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:34.620
Are you sure about this, Leona?
Isn't this stealing?

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:39.540
It's fine. How is my using
palace equipment stealing?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.190
I guess so.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:46.130
Oh, right. Shouldn't we have
invited Popp, too?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:50.200
Popp? Oh, right, that Mage.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.790
Why bother? He doesn't seem too reliable.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.370
It's like he doesn't have much experience.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.750
It probably wouldn't make
a difference even if he came.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:01.960
<i>Why that little...!</i>

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:05.170
He's a lot more reliable than he looks.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:05.880
<i>Oh?</i>

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:11.860
Really? He's the type who runs away
the moment the party is in danger.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.100
And who asked you?!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.830
Oh, you're here.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:20.540
And I was hoping to enjoy
an adventure alone with Dai.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.060
Why you little...!

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:30.200
Bengarna is considered
the safest country in the world.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:36.910
With an advanced military and industry,
it's kept the Dark Army at bay

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.120
using its abundance of
weapons and resources

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:41.920
backed by the world's greatest economy.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.210
Let's go!

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:50.720
Go! Go!

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:54.340
Hey! Slow down a little!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.740
This is nothing!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.180
What is with her?!

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:05.420
It's not a big deal.
I'm actually a little relieved.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:07.520
What?!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:12.840
Back in Papnica,
Leona has to be a leader for everyone.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.280
So she seemed a little distant.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:20.410
But now, she seems
more lively and like herself!

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:26.530
So we're here
for her stress relief or something?

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:29.530
Oh! There's a castle!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:32.760
Don't be silly.
What castle has balloon like that?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.600
Huh?

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.680
Go!

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.930
Leona, you're going too fast!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.730
So this is a department store?

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:48.690
It's huge! Is it really full of stores?!

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:51.320
Let's go!

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:57.280
This is amazing. It's a hundred times
bigger than my family weapon store.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:58.910
4F CLOTHES, ARMOUR
3F HOUSEHOLD ITEMS

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:02.080
You can't come here without
checking out the basement!

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.510
2F MAGIC ITEMS
1F JEWELRY, COSMETICS

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.080
Wait up!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.750
What is this room? It's empty.

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:14.510
We're trapped!

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.350
The room is falling!

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:23.520
Calm down. It's called an elevator
and it takes you to each floor.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:33.900
There's herbs and seeds
I've never seen before!

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:37.780
Two Slime Buns
and one Slime Tapioca please.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.870
Sure thing. That'll be ten gold.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:42.830
Here.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.250
Are Slimes safe to eat?

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:51.460
It's not real.
It's a snack shaped like a Slime.

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:58.760
Huh? There's something inside.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:05.390
Congratulations! You found a Small Medal!

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.320
What is this thing for?

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:11.190
I dunno.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.800
3F HOUSEHOLD ITEMS

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:16.240
It's super high-quality Horse Manure!

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.910
It's so bright, I can't see anything!

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:24.640
Luxuries like these really make
the department-store experience.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.730
Sir. Sir.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.390
Huh? Me?

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.550
That's a nice buckle there.

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:31.580
Seriously?

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.180
I mean. Isn't it ugly?

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.140
Especially the face.

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:42.740
No, it's a wonderful buckle.
I'll pay you 500 gold for it.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.310
500 gold?! That much?!

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:57.050
It won't come off.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.610
Hmm. It's definitely cursed.

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:06.560
AVAN STRASH

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.560
HELL'S CLAW

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:20.260
Sirs! See my latest product! Both attack
and defense in this all-purpose helm!

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.140
I call it...

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.970
The Blockhead Basher!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:27.910
Come and get it!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:28.770
No way.

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:29.890
No way.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:34.540
Buy one now and I'll throw in
another one for free!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.030
Okay. Let's go.

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:36.860
Right.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.880
Why don't these sell?

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:43.490
Wow. This is so cool!

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.160
Wow!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.080
So cool!

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:55.340
Whoa! 3,800 gold?!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:58.050
Maybe I shouldn't have touched it.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:02.180
Dai, feel free to buy anything
less than 5,000 gold.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:08.560
Metals and cloth
from Papnica sell for a lot.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:12.980
If I sell these dresses,
it should get us 20 to 30,000 gold.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.860
She's a real princess.

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.300
DRESSING ROOM

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:18.150
Hey.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:19.570
How about this?

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.830
What kind of Sage dresses like that?

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.500
Huh? Then how about this?

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:36.500
Here!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:41.530
Meow!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.590
Wear something more serious!

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:47.600
Oh come on.
This actually has pretty high defense.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.270
What about you, Popp?

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:55.110
I'm good. I got a new weapon
and cape already.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:56.380
You pick something.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.070
In that case, I want that.

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:08.700
I guess this will do.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.850
Are you sure you want that?

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:20.170
It's fine! I'll get used to it!

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:24.220
Okay, let's find Dai a new weapon.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.560
Ow...

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:40.060
You know, I don't feel much stronger.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:44.860
Oh? What's that?

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.950
A Dragonsbane!

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.410
Huh? The famous weapon?

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:56.380
Yes. It can pierce a Dragon's hide,
which is said to be harder than steel.

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:58.480
It's a top quality weapon.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.550
But, it's expensive, right?

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:01.590
Huh?

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.610
There's no price.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:09.840
My friends, this is our only piece,
so it will be put on auction.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.240
An auction.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:16.810
Come on, these things
go for over 15,000 Gold.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:19.190
You can't buy it
with Mommy's allowance.

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:21.150
Come here, you two!

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:26.990
Dai, Popp, let's buy that Dragonsbane!

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:28.930
Are you serious?!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.800
I have 16,000 gold right here!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.140
Don't bother!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.160
Huh?!

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:40.670
Using weapons more powerful than you are.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:47.240
Don't waste your money like one of
those fools pretending to be strong.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.340
Are you talking about us?!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.620
Who else is there?

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:53.780
Why you...!

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.930
That's enough, Grandmother.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:01.900
Please forgive us.
My grandmother has a foul mouth.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.980
I merely call them as I see them.

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.700
Hmph! What was that?!

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:15.080
They looked like Seers.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:19.290
Yeah. But the young one
was kind of cute.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.540
You're so stupid.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:27.960
This country's finished.
All that's advanced is its appearance.

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.680
What is it, Merle?

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.850
Grandmother, something's coming.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:37.870
Many monsters with terrifying power!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:41.060
What?! I haven't sensed anything yet!

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:46.590
Merle, it seems you've developed
our bloodline's power.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.650
They're coming! They're close!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:57.580
What is that?!

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:09.570
A Hydra!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.720
F-Fire! Fire!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.530
Our cannon's aren't working!

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:35.410
Just how tough is its hide?!

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.420
17,000!

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:43.250
17,500!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.750
18,000!

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.880
That's enough, Princess. Come on.

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:54.320
We're already 2,000 gold over our limit.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.430
If no one else will bid, that's it!

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:01.850
We're fine! I've got this!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.560
19--

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:09.070
Sold! Today's feature item,
the Dragonsbane,

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:15.240
has been sold to the merchant,
Mr. Gopple, for 18,000 gold!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.490
Check it out!

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:17.890
Wow! Good job!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.620
Honestly! What are you doing, Gomechan?!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:28.440
It's okay, Leona.
I can fight with a normal weapon.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:35.090
But I can't stand letting those goons
have such a good weapon!

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:38.180
It would be far better in our hands!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.310
W-What's that?!

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.310
Look at that!

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.500
An army of Dragons!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.810
I see one Hydra, and Dragons...

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:53.650
One, two, three, four, five...

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:54.900
Five Dragons!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:58.840
Is that the Dragon Legion
of the Dark Army?!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:04.390
Hey! You bought the Dragonsbane, right?!
Use it to drive them off!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:08.920
Don't be stupid!
I bought this to make money!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.250
Huh. Pathetic.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:18.220
That said, with that many Dragons,
we might be in over our heads.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:26.060
Let's fight! We should fight!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:33.550
Those Dragons might have
come here seeking us!

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:39.200
And we should buy time
so that everyone can evacuate!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:43.250
<i>She'll even protect people like that.</i>

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:44.040
Okay!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:50.880
Princess, you've changed
my opinion about you.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:56.510
I guess true leaders
prove themselves under fire.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.720
My opinion of you
still hasn't changed though.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:03.020
Just watch me!

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:06.640
Dai, I'll take care of the Dragons!

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:09.230
You take the big guy!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.230
Okay!

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:13.520
Princess, you evacuate the people in here!

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:15.730
Got it!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:23.260
Come on people!
We need to get out of here! Now!

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.330
Okay! Here I go!

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:49.770
This isn't working!

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.230
Let's go, Gomechan!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:07.160
I guess five Dragons is a little much!

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.250
Okay! In that case!

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:15.420
Let me show you how fast I've learned
to flee from all my battles!!

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.550
Follow me!

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.560
Hurry! Hurry and run!

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:35.920
Mommy!

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.110
Mommy! Mommy!

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.360
Wait, Merle! Where are you going?!

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:48.100
I have to help those people.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.710
Don't be a fool!

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:53.460
What can simple Seers like us do?!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:55.540
Seers...

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.550
That's right.

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:02.390
We knew when to run because we could
foresee when the Dark Army was coming.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:05.550
We've survived
by moving from town to town.

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:07.760
But...

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.270
I've had enough!

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:20.010
I'm tired of fleeing towns, knowing
many people will be hurt or killed!

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.780
Merle, wait! Merle!

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:24.470
Foolish child.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.620
Mommy! Mommy!

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:28.370
Please! Help my mommy!

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:30.660
We have to move this rock!

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.670
Wave Slash!

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:25.800
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:25.800
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:32.810
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:32.810
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:36.020
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:36.020
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:43.980
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:43.980
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:46.530
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:46.530
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.690 --> 00:22:52.660
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.690 --> 00:22:52.660
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:57.330
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:57.330
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:01.540
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:01.540
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:08.010
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:08.010
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:13.850
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:13.850
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:19.140
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:19.140
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:33.990 --> 00:23:37.290
<i>An army of Dragons
attacks the Bengarna castle town.</i>

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:43.520
<i>Using the power of his mark, Dai faces
a giant Dragon with a hide of steel.</i>

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:49.320
<i>The Seers Nabara and Merle watch
the battle and are shocked by Dai's mark.</i>

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:53.680
<i>What truth will Nabara reveal?</i>

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:56.430
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:58.100
<i>"The Dragon Knight"</i>

00:23:58.100 --> 00:24:00.020
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
